        },
        {
          "text": "Lino mumwezi wamusanu aibili, Ismayeli mwana wa-Netaniya mwana wa-Elisama, umwi silunyungu waciinga cabwami, wakasika, Wakeza abasilutwe bamwami abantu bali ikumi, elyo bakasika kuli-Gedaliya mwana wa-Ahikamu ku-Mizipa, nkabela bakalya insima boonse antoomwe nkukonya oko ku-Mizipa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:2"
          },
          "items": [
