                  "text": "19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino Ismayeli wakanjizya mubuzike bantu boonse ibakasyeede ibakali ku-Mizipa, bana basimbi bamwami abantu boonse ibakasyeede ku-Mizipa, Nebuzaradana silutwe wampi mbaakapa mumaanza aa-Gedaliya mwana wa-Ahikamu. Ismayeli mwana wa-Netaniya wakabanjizya mubuzike, elyo wakainka kuyoozubuka kuya kubana ba-Amoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.10"
            ]
          }
        }
