        },
        {
          "text": "Lino Johanani mwana waKareya abasilutwe boonse babasilumamba mbaakali abo bakatolelela bantu bamwi boonse ibakasyeede, Ismayeli mwana wa-Netaniya mbaakatolede mubuzike kuzwa ku-Mizipa kusule lyakujaya Gedaliya mwana wa-Ahikamu. Bakatolelela baalumi basilumamba abanakazi abana abazibe, nkokuti boonse buyo johanani mbaakapilusya kuzwa ku-Gibeoni. ",
          "type": "text",
